08:17.870 --> 08:19.200
Jangan berkelahi lagi!

08:24.310 --> 08:25.070
Xiao Yao.

08:27.240 --> 08:28.240
Pianpian.

08:38.390 --> 08:39.030
Pianpian.

08:41.240 --> 08:41.840
Xiao Yao.

08:41.840 --> 08:42.440
Hong Ye.

08:45.150 --> 08:45.670
Mu!

