35:14.080 --> 35:14.370
[Kedai Mi Xu]

35:19.420 --> 35:22.770
[Kedai Mi Xu]

35:29.070 --> 35:31.150
Kakak, aku buta huruf.

35:31.150 --> 35:34.400
